WEBVTT

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.880
That Cui Wenkui won't listen to reason.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.210
He really pisses me off.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.160
He is a man of ambition.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.960
It's just a pity his ambition is misplaced.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.240
I should have just knocked him out earlier

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.400
and carried him out.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.120
But your criticism in the prison was spot on.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.280
What you said was very insightful.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.100
It hit the nail on the head.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.240
I just say whatever comes to mind.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.060
It's rare that you would actually praise me.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.480
I will keep it in mind.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.520
Don't just say nice things.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.479
I want action.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:11.940
Look at you.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.760
I just praised you for making progress,

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:15.680
and you went back to your true colors immediately.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.410
I haven't even said what I want.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.680
How do you know I went back to my true colors?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.000
Okay, tell me.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.200
I want you to take me with you

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.520
on every mission.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.680
I want to make progress with you.

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.160
No problem.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.720
I can promise you.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.120
Except for special missions,

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:35.820
I will take you with me.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:36.930
It's a deal then.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:38.440
It's a deal.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.480
I don't think either of you made any progress.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.740
You both have to write a self-criticism.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.720
Aren't you in charge of the guerrilla?

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.579
How come you have time to come out?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.720
Secretary Peng Tao from the West Henan Special Committee is here.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:55.840
He wants to see you.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.450
Secretary Peng is here?

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:00.090
Let's go.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.600
Let's go see him.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:08.720
Secretary Peng, have some water.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:11.050
They should be back soon, Secretary Peng.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:14.920
Baozi, this is our Secretary Peng Tao.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:17.079
This is Comrade Cai Baozi.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.840
Secretary Peng, we've finally been looking forward to you.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.720
Hello.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.280
Hello, Comrade Cai Baozi.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.440
Please sit.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.000
Come, let's sit.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.380
Comrade Cai Baozi,

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.810
you've been in Sandaoyuan for so long,

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.850
and this is our first time meeting.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.800
But your name

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.880
is well-known to me.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.120
Blowing up the Qinglong Mountain Fortress

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.880
and attacking the Japanese transport trucks.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:45.940
You did a great job.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.040
None of the comrades in the Eighth Route Army Office

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.640
doesn't know you.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.560
You flatter me.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.120
Since Shanzhou City fell,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.760
we lost contact with the party organization.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.600
Under the leadership of Comrade Cui Wenpei,

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.730
we organized the scattered swordsmen

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.480
and spontaneously organized anti-Japanese activities.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.200
But without the guidance of the party organization,

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.040
we just rely on our personal experience

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:11.960
and mess around

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.920
without a clear direction.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.520
Good job.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:16.839
Now,

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.160
the Japanese stopped at Hanguguan.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.240
It is said that their logistics supply line cannot keep up.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.360
This is

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.320
thanks to you.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:31.900
Moreover, Qinglong Village guards the main roads on three sides.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.180
With your actions,

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.159
the Japanese have lost

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.780
substantial control over the counties.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.320
The guerrilla forces below

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.840
can fight so well.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.170
We still need Secretary Peng's guidance.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:48.880
Who is this girl?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.240
Shangguan Ying from Qinglong Village.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.720
You are Shangguan Bao's daughter.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.440
You truly are the fierce daughter of a hero.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.400
You flatter me.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:03.900
What do you say?

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.760
Are you willing to join the Eighth Route Army

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.680
and fight the Japanese with us?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:09.560
I am.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.440
As long as I'm with Baozi,

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.410
I'm willing to do anything.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.400
This girl is very sincere to you.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.320
Don't let her down.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.960
Yes, Secretary.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.080
The war of resistance is our priority now.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:27.720
So we decided

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.560
to put our relationship on hold

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.360
until we drive out the Japanese.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.280
Nonsense.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.200
When did the organization ever say

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.000
you can't have a personal life while fighting the war?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.240
The revolution also needs

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.760
to be passed down from generation to generation.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.880
Comrade Secretary, I agreed to this.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.840
My man must have great ambitions.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.090
I just criticized him once,

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.000
and you're already defending him.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.120
Incredible.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.640
I really can't mess with you young couple.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.600
This girl is nice. She knows how to care for her man.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.090
Secretary Peng,

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.120
you risked your life coming to Sandaoyuan.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.380
Is there any task you want to assign to us?

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.800
The comrades from the Eighth Route Army Office and I

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.800
have discussed it

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.100
and decided to officially establish

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.860
an armed force behind enemy lines in Sandaoyuan

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.920
to unite all anti-Japanese forces.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:26.640
In Japanese-occupied, controlled, and adjacent areas,

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.360
by using scattered and mobile tactics,

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.210
we will strike the enemy

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:34.159
and cut off their transportation lines.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.240
That's great.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.490
We've finally waited for this day.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:48.880
On behalf of the Eighth Route Army Office, I officially announce

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.159
the establishment of the Western Henan Anti-Japanese Independent Battalion.

00:06:56.159 --> 00:06:58.280
Comrade Cai Baozi is appointed

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.290
as the captain of the Independent Battalion.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.400
Comrade Cui Wenpei is appointed as the political commissar of the Independent Battalion,

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.800
specifically in charge of propaganda,

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:11.360
guerrilla warfare, and united front work in Sandaoyuan.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:18.640
The two new comrades, Shangguan Ying and Yuanshangfei, are appointed

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.600
as the vice captains of the Independent Battalion,

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.600
responsible for assisting with your execution work.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.960
Please rest assured.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.080
We promise to complete the task.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.170
Comrade Secretary,

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.600
since you appointed me as the vice captain,

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.800
I have something to report to you.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.920
Sit down and talk.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.480
Well, sit down.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.659
Comrade Shangguan Ying is very bold.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.640
A new broom sweeps clean.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.520
Come, tell me.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:55.840
What kind of work?

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:02.240
Cui Wenkui was framed by Zhang Gongyan.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.560
We want to rescue him. Please approve it.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.360
Yinger.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.400
Tell me your reasons.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.920
After arriving at Sandaoyuan, he was dedicated to resisting the Japanese.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.840
He never bullies the common people.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:17.920
As you said,

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.680
everything should focus on the big picture.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.680
We need manpower for the resistance now.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.320
A talent like him should be saved.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.600
On the way here,

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.400
I also heard about this.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.039
Although Cui Wenkui is in the National Army,

00:08:37.039 --> 00:08:37.919
he has

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:40.919
killed enemies

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.640
and bled on the front lines.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.240
Currently, the enemy is strong and we are weak.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.760
Our united anti-Japanese forces

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:51.320
should include patriotic generals like Cui Wenkui.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.960
It is exactly because of their existence

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.240
that our nation has hope.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:02.120
If they die in vain,

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.600
it would be self-destruction.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.040
Yes.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.400
I will execute the rescue immediately.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:13.800
I'll go with you.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.160
Yes.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:36.460
Brigadier Cui,

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.680
let's hit the road.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:42.820
Didn't they say we'd leave in the afternoon?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.120
It's not even noon yet.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.760
The time has been changed. It's earlier.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.800
Stop being vain.

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.120
When you get to Yama,

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.960
he won't care if you're dressed neatly.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.040
Everyone gets fried in a cauldron of boiling oil.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.500
If you go to the other side,

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.000
don't blame me.

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.680
I am just following orders.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.610
What are you talking about?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.480
The theater commander said there is no need for a trial.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:25.340
Anyone who defects to the Communists and betrays the Party will be executed on the spot.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.280
Bullshit.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.320
Do you know how many times the headquarters

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:32.850
has awarded me the Medal of Loyalty and Valor?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.400
Just because you tell the Party and the State that I defected,

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.440
does that mean I actually did?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.680
Look closely.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.000
Black and white with a red seal.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.320
I wouldn't dare forge it.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.440
Even if I had the guts,

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.400
I wouldn't dare fake it.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.840
I originally thought

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.840
the Theater Commander would at least give you a symbolic trial.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.160
But before we even set out today,

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.680
he sent someone with the verdict.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.370
It seems his determination to kill you

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.410
is even stronger than mine.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:21.120
Cui Wenkui.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.140
I don't actually want to kill you.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.100
I was still counting on you

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:27.280
to help me hold the last position

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.520
at Sandaoyuan.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:31.960
But you,

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:35.400
you're just too stubborn to understand.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.050
Have you figured it out yet?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.400
All these years,

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.140
not only have you failed to get promoted,

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:44.840
you've also lost your life.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.000
Think about it.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.200
Do I have the power

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.680
to swallow all those military supplies and pay by myself?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.200
I'll tell you the truth.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:01.320
The Theater Command is full of big tigers.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.440
Every single one of them has an appetite

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.000
bigger than mine.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.760
And you are so stubborn.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:12.640
Commander.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:15.640
I advised you several times, but you wouldn't listen.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.680
You refuse to get on the bus,

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.810
and you won't let others get on either.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:23.320
If they don't kill you, who will they kill?

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.760
Cui Wenkui.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.800
Male, 29 years old.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.960
From Peiping.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.620
Currently residing in Shanzhou.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.960
Charge of colluding with the Communists and treason.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.680
Executed on the spot.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.960
I fought to the death for the party and the country,

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.920
and you're going to kill me over this, huh?

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.160
Cui Wenkui.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.680
The Japanese are so powerful now.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.080
Everyone is trying to find a way out,

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.080
only fools like you would charge forward.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.760
Men, take him away!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:28.840
Go.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:32.040
Don't touch me with your dirty hands.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:43.440
Go.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.920
Thank you for speaking up for my brother earlier.

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.120
I only said what everyone wanted to say.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.360
Your brother cannot die.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:58.840
And these days,

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.220
you should know me.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.520
I am a straightforward person,

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.520
and I can't keep anything to myself.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:05.850
Secretary Peng agreed.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.560
So my brother has hope.

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.560
I will definitely remember this favor.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:11.640
I'm just worried

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.090
that your brother is too stubborn.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:15.800
I'm afraid it will be like last time,

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.240
and we will make a wasted trip.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:19.640
I'll tie him up and take him away if I have to.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.960
I can't lose my brother no matter what.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:23.370
With your words,

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.560
we can act without hesitation.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:27.000
There's not much time left.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.200
Don't worry too much.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.490
In these mountains,

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:31.960
our swordsmen are faster than leopards.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.300
Brothers, let's pick up the pace.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.480
A life is at stake.

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:36.240
Yes, yes, yes.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.440
Get up. Let's go.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:56.800
Cui Wenkui.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:00.920
Cui Wenkui.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:06.520
You are exactly like your father.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.920
Back then, your father refused to accept our bribes

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.320
and went to the Nanjing government to report us

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.200
for extorting wealth and bleeding the people dry.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.480
As a result,

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.320
we got rid of him.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.400
Now you're blocking our way to wealth

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.960
and refusing to accept our reorganization obediently.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.020
As a result, we're executing you too.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:35.080
Why are you father and son

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.560
so stubborn?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.760
Are you saying

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.200
that my father

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.760
was killed by you?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.040
That's right, we killed him.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.380
Your father was the deputy mayor of Beiping.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.040
Who would dare to kill him openly?

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:57.240
After I got rid of him,

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.640
I had it publicized in the newspapers,

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.300
claiming it was retaliation by the Communists.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:05.880
And everyone believed it.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.400
Beat him.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.100
I've said what I needed to say.

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:26.680
Just accept your fate

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.320
and die knowing the truth.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.360
Consider this

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.240
my last act of comradeship to you.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.570
Prepare for execution.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.520
Zhang Gongyan.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.520
I won't let you off even as a ghost.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.480
I will tear you to pieces!

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:47.760
Ready.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.440
Brigade Commander.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:56.960
Brother.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.200
Brigade Commander, go!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:16:59.800
Untie him.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.400
Go!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.520
Give me the gun. Go!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.080
Brigade Commander, go! Hurry!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.200
Go! Go! Go!

00:17:04.839 --> 00:17:06.280
Go! Go! Go!

00:17:08.359 --> 00:17:09.490
Brothers, retreat!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.200
Retreat!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.200
Go!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.040
Commander.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.920
Cui Wenkui and the swordsmen have all run away.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:27.800
Should we still pursue them?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:28.560
Nonsense!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:29.840
If we don't pursue them,

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.040
how will we explain this to the headquarters?

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.700
If our embezzlement of military pay is exposed,

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:35.880
we will spend the rest of our lives

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.040
in prison.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:37.960
Go.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:38.730
Yes, sir.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.680
Brothers, after them!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:41.800
Go!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:47.920
Stay close behind.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:50.340
Keep up, hurry.

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:51.920
Hurry, hurry.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.160
Hurry.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:02.920
Take a break, take a break.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.120
Slow down, slow down.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.080
Sit here.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.400
Everyone, take a break here.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.240
The pursuers are gone.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.360
We are safe for now.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.320
Brother, are you alright?

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:21.600
Everyone.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.520
Words cannot express my gratitude.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.680
If you ever need my help in the future,

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.120
I will gladly risk my life for you.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.120
Don't say that.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.720
Cui Wenkui,

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.650
join our guerrilla forces.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.520
Miss Shangguan.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.560
I am disheartened now

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.760
and don't want to join any organization.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.920
Please understand.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.560
Then what are your plans next?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.000
I'm thinking of

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.320
pulling my independent brigade out first

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.920
and forming a separate anti-Japanese column.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.920
But don't worry.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.120
I will only fight the Japanese like before.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.570
I won't get involved in anything else.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.120
That's not a bad idea.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.280
We can watch each other's backs

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.610
and support each other.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.420
There are advantages to not being together.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.240
Yes.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.080
Let's go then.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.860
Let's go find your troops.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.160
Wenpei,

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:49.120
Before I pull my troops out,

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.480
I have to do something for our Cui family.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:01.290
Listen up, troops at all checkpoints.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:05.560
We must block Cui Wenkui's escape route.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.410
He might be heading to the Communists.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.090
Deploy a regiment of troops

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.680
on his inevitable path,

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.680
equipped with heavy weapons.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.560
Eliminate him on his way back

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.680
and send him to meet his dead father.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.220
Are you looking for me?

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.080
You!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:24.760
Guards!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.840
Stop shouting.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.360
Those cowards

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:29.960
have already surrendered.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.640
Commander Zhang.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.920
You told me such a huge secret,

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.180
did you think I wouldn't come for you?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.360
Wenkui.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.400
Don't kill me.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.840
Spare me.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.140
I didn't want to kill your father either.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.000
It's just that...

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.330
If I didn't kill him,

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.240
they would have killed me.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.320
So

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:09.360
you killed my father

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:12.920
and framed the Communists for it?

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:14.760
And you kept this hidden from me

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:17.160
for twenty whole years?

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.280
Wenkui.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:22.320
Wenkui.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.040
Wenkui.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.040
Spare me,

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:36.480
for the sake of

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.280
working together in the National Army.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.280
Please spare me.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:43.650
The party and state.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.680
When the party and state escorted me to the execution ground

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.360
to kill me,

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:57.920
my devotion to them died.

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:03.920
A country with scums like you.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.280
If you can't stabilize the country from within,

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:08.080
or defend against enemies from the outside,

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:11.010
the people will never live in peace and contentment.

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:14.880
Go down and apologize to my father.

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:19.320
Wen... Wenkui,

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:21.240
don't kill me.

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:22.890
I'll give you money.

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:24.240
I have US dollars.

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:26.160
I have gold bars.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:27.840
Wenkui.

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:37.980
I'll burn this for you.

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:07.920
Brothers.

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.690
You've all followed me for over ten years.

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:15.840
Tell me,

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:19.640
do you still remember why you joined the army?

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:24.240
The warlords were fighting,

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:26.170
and the people were suffering.

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:28.420
Many brothers told me,

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:29.890
Brigade Commander,

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:34.440
I want to fight all over the map with you.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:36.280
When the fighting is over,

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:38.680
then go home and reunite with our families.

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:42.360
I, Cui Wenkui, have kept these words in my heart

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:44.160
for over ten years.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.200
But once the war started, it never ended.

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:50.480
The Central Plains War ended,

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.600
and then the Japanese invaded.

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:58.000
Many brothers were about to return home,

00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:01.440
only to be sent back to the battlefield.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.120
After fighting for so long,

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:06.760
sometimes I ask myself,

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:09.640
what keeps me going.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:12.120
What's the reason?

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:17.600
I look back at the homeland behind me

00:24:18.040 --> 00:24:19.480
and think of my family.

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:21.560
That is the reason we don't fear sacrifice

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.040
and keep holding on.

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:26.600
But when we're fighting on the front lines,

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:29.540
what are those high officials doing in the rear?

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.960
They are living in luxury and partying.

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:34.880
When they are in danger,

00:24:34.880 --> 00:24:36.680
they will hand over our great country

00:24:36.680 --> 00:24:37.760
without a fight.

00:24:38.680 --> 00:24:41.520
Do we bleed and sacrifice for them?

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:43.450
Are the battles we fight

00:24:43.760 --> 00:24:45.960
just to protect their power and status?

00:24:46.240 --> 00:24:47.160
No.

00:24:47.480 --> 00:24:49.680
Then are you still willing to follow such a government?

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:50.840
No.

00:24:51.480 --> 00:24:52.240
Exactly.

00:24:52.640 --> 00:24:53.760
Such a government,

00:24:54.240 --> 00:24:55.720
we can no longer follow.

00:24:56.080 --> 00:24:58.080
We must be like the Communist Party

00:24:58.520 --> 00:25:00.380
and fight the Japanese together.

00:25:00.760 --> 00:25:01.640
Of course,

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:03.800
if any brothers want to go back,

00:25:06.600 --> 00:25:07.720
here is some money.

00:25:08.160 --> 00:25:09.160
Take it,

00:25:09.520 --> 00:25:12.840
go back and reunite with your families.

00:25:14.840 --> 00:25:16.160
Brigade Commander, we will follow you.

00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:17.720
We will follow you.

00:25:19.240 --> 00:25:20.280
Good.

00:25:22.400 --> 00:25:23.640
You are all brave men.

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:25.160
From today on,

00:25:25.680 --> 00:25:27.610
We are no longer the National Army.

00:25:27.840 --> 00:25:31.480
We are the Sandaoyuan Anti-Japanese Independent Column.

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:24.120
Our father

00:26:25.280 --> 00:26:29.560
worked for the Kuomintang his whole life.

00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:32.560
Me too.

00:26:34.000 --> 00:26:36.240
But in the end, it was all for nothing.

00:26:39.520 --> 00:26:42.250
I didn't expect him to be killed by his own people.

00:26:46.040 --> 00:26:47.520
I am even more ridiculous.

00:26:49.600 --> 00:26:50.560
For the past twenty years,

00:26:50.560 --> 00:26:52.840
I always thought the Communists did it.

00:27:00.720 --> 00:27:01.600
Baozi.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:07.360
About your father.

00:27:16.240 --> 00:27:17.080
Wenkui,

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:18.740
what are you doing?

00:27:19.360 --> 00:27:21.000
Sit down and talk.

00:27:21.520 --> 00:27:22.360
Sit.

00:27:26.360 --> 00:27:27.720
Here, drink some water.

00:27:31.720 --> 00:27:34.050
Actually, this can't all be blamed on you.

00:27:35.720 --> 00:27:39.320
It's all Zhang Gongyan's fault.

00:27:41.240 --> 00:27:43.100
It's good that you woke up in time.

00:27:43.360 --> 00:27:45.520
Everything can be remedied.

00:27:47.720 --> 00:27:50.880
Let's put past grievances aside for now.

00:27:51.760 --> 00:27:54.240
We brothers should fight the enemy together first.

00:27:54.240 --> 00:27:55.840
That's the important thing.

00:27:56.200 --> 00:27:57.600
Isn't there a saying,

00:27:57.920 --> 00:28:01.850
brothers may quarrel at home, but they unite against outside threats.

00:28:05.880 --> 00:28:07.480
You don't need to comfort me.

00:28:07.520 --> 00:28:08.960
But don't worry, Baozi.

00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:12.600
I will definitely fight bloody battles on the battlefield

00:28:12.600 --> 00:28:15.060
to repay the kindness of you and your father.

00:28:16.800 --> 00:28:18.000
All right, all right.

00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:19.800
Let's not talk about this today.

00:28:22.000 --> 00:28:25.200
The Japanese are planning to attack Hangu Pass now,

00:28:25.640 --> 00:28:27.840
but their logistics are insufficient,

00:28:28.000 --> 00:28:30.860
so they largely depend on cashing out the gold mine.

00:28:30.880 --> 00:28:32.320
If they take Hangu Pass,

00:28:32.640 --> 00:28:35.640
the entire Qinchuan will lose its barrier,

00:28:35.920 --> 00:28:37.250
and will fall very soon.

00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:40.520
In the end,

00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:42.840
the gold mine is the crucial issue.

00:28:44.640 --> 00:28:45.320
Baozi,

00:28:45.640 --> 00:28:47.240
how about we do what you said,

00:28:47.360 --> 00:28:48.720
and blow it up?

00:28:49.200 --> 00:28:51.000
If blowing it up is the only way,

00:28:51.320 --> 00:28:53.040
how do we do it? Who will do it?

00:28:53.400 --> 00:28:55.120
What about the civilians inside?

00:28:55.120 --> 00:28:56.560
Who will rescue them?

00:28:56.960 --> 00:28:57.880
I will.

00:28:59.480 --> 00:29:00.800
My team and I will go.

00:29:01.280 --> 00:29:02.880
We will blow up the gold mine.

00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:07.880
Wenkui, it really won't work.

00:29:08.320 --> 00:29:09.800
As soon as you move out,

00:29:10.120 --> 00:29:11.840
you will be spotted by the Japanese.

00:29:11.840 --> 00:29:13.640
Even if you can fight your way in,

00:29:14.120 --> 00:29:15.250
the Japanese around

00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:17.860
will come from all directions to reinforce.

00:29:18.280 --> 00:29:20.940
You won't be able to escape even if you blow it up.

00:29:20.960 --> 00:29:22.160
You and your brothers

00:29:22.560 --> 00:29:23.840
will all die inside.

00:29:24.120 --> 00:29:25.120
It's not worth it.

00:29:25.320 --> 00:29:26.680
Baozi, you know me.

00:29:27.120 --> 00:29:29.050
As long as we can stop the Japanese,

00:29:29.800 --> 00:29:31.800
I'm willing to die a thousand times.

00:29:33.000 --> 00:29:35.000
We all admire your military spirit,

00:29:35.240 --> 00:29:37.300
but what about the civilians inside?

00:29:37.920 --> 00:29:39.160
Our difficulty now

00:29:39.600 --> 00:29:41.000
is to blow up the gold mine

00:29:41.200 --> 00:29:43.120
while ensuring their safety.

00:29:50.200 --> 00:29:50.640
Right.

00:29:50.800 --> 00:29:53.730
You Communists think this through more thoroughly.

00:29:54.320 --> 00:29:55.800
But if so,

00:29:56.560 --> 00:29:58.820
this mission will be even more daunting.

00:30:00.160 --> 00:30:01.760
Isn't Uncle Liu in the mine?

00:30:02.080 --> 00:30:03.400
If we can contact him,

00:30:03.760 --> 00:30:05.760
we can coordinate from the inside and outside.

00:30:05.760 --> 00:30:07.120
Blow up the mine

00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:10.520
while he helps the civilians retreat.

00:30:11.320 --> 00:30:12.880
That idea is workable.

00:30:13.720 --> 00:30:16.080
The key is who should go.

00:30:16.560 --> 00:30:18.360
How to get in and out?

00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:21.320
If the message can't be sent out, it's useless.

00:30:46.280 --> 00:30:47.360
Even if you're in a bad mood,

00:30:47.360 --> 00:30:48.680
don't waste food.

00:30:50.640 --> 00:30:52.160
I'll pick it up in a minute.

00:30:55.520 --> 00:30:58.120
Why is fighting a war so difficult?

00:30:58.960 --> 00:31:01.600
Worrying about this and that.

00:31:02.240 --> 00:31:03.480
It makes us so timid.

00:31:04.400 --> 00:31:07.360
What? Do you disagree with Wenpei's idea?

00:31:08.080 --> 00:31:08.920
No.

00:31:09.400 --> 00:31:10.760
I think she's right.

00:31:11.200 --> 00:31:13.000
It's just that I can't help right now,

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:14.320
so I feel frustrated.

00:31:14.680 --> 00:31:16.200
You play a big role too.

00:31:17.280 --> 00:31:18.000
So many swordsmen

00:31:18.000 --> 00:31:19.800
have united to fight Japan.

00:31:20.600 --> 00:31:22.600
It's all thanks to your leadership.

00:31:22.840 --> 00:31:24.280
Wenpei and I

00:31:24.280 --> 00:31:26.410
don't have as much influence as you do.

00:31:26.880 --> 00:31:27.840
But in the past,

00:31:28.120 --> 00:31:29.760
everyone only looked out for themselves,

00:31:29.760 --> 00:31:31.160
so it was simple and easy.

00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:33.200
Now we have to think of others,

00:31:34.120 --> 00:31:35.640
so we must be thorough.

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.480
But this problem

00:31:40.120 --> 00:31:41.800
seems hard to solve.

00:31:42.240 --> 00:31:44.800
Even you and Wenpei are out of ideas.

00:31:46.280 --> 00:31:47.810
You're a vice-captain now.

00:31:48.040 --> 00:31:49.570
Why are you so pessimistic?

00:31:49.800 --> 00:31:50.840
The harder it is,

00:31:50.840 --> 00:31:52.920
the more it shows your Baozi's capability.

00:31:52.920 --> 00:31:54.650
If we only met simple problems,

00:31:55.080 --> 00:31:56.600
I wouldn't feel a sense of achievement.

00:31:56.600 --> 00:31:58.720
How else could I establish my authority

00:31:58.720 --> 00:32:00.050
in front of you, my lady?

00:32:01.360 --> 00:32:03.490
You want to establish your authority?

00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:06.000
Miss, Baozi.

00:32:07.960 --> 00:32:09.280
I just went out to scout

00:32:09.280 --> 00:32:11.080
and ran into the Japs collecting grain in Dawang Town.

00:32:11.080 --> 00:32:13.160
Guess who led the way for them?

00:32:13.600 --> 00:32:14.160
Who?

00:32:14.440 --> 00:32:15.480
Meng Shigui.

00:32:18.040 --> 00:32:18.920
He's still alive?

00:32:18.920 --> 00:32:20.040
He fled

00:32:20.040 --> 00:32:21.400
when Chief Huo was fighting

00:32:21.400 --> 00:32:22.440
Tahara Masao.

00:32:22.800 --> 00:32:24.320
He hid at home for a while.

00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:25.760
Then Tahara Masao found him,

00:32:25.760 --> 00:32:27.520
and he started working for them.

00:32:27.520 --> 00:32:28.880
Do you know where he is?

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:30.840
He lives in the detective squad compound in the county town.

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:32.200
It's not easy to make a move.

00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:33.240
But I found out

00:32:33.240 --> 00:32:34.520
that he often goes to the restaurant

00:32:34.520 --> 00:32:35.600
with a bunch of his bad friends

00:32:35.600 --> 00:32:37.880
and drinks until midnight before going back.

00:32:37.880 --> 00:32:38.640
Let's go.

00:32:39.280 --> 00:32:40.410
Where are you going?

00:32:40.480 --> 00:32:41.240
Need you ask?

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:43.100
To get rid of that scum, of course.

00:32:43.960 --> 00:32:45.020
Don't be reckless.

00:32:45.040 --> 00:32:46.240
Let's discuss it first.

00:32:46.240 --> 00:32:47.640
What's there to discuss?

00:32:47.640 --> 00:32:48.680
He colluded with the Japs.

00:32:48.680 --> 00:32:50.280
and harmed his own brothers.

00:32:50.440 --> 00:32:52.440
Such a person deserves to die twice.

00:32:52.800 --> 00:32:54.280
We can't touch the gold mine,

00:32:54.280 --> 00:32:55.740
but we can still touch him.

00:33:12.080 --> 00:33:13.760
Miss, Meng Shigui is inside.

00:33:14.040 --> 00:33:15.040
Let's make our move.

00:33:15.040 --> 00:33:16.200
There are too many people in the restaurant right now.

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:18.240
If we make a move, we might easily hurt others.

00:33:18.240 --> 00:33:18.920
No rush.

00:33:19.280 --> 00:33:20.940
Let's wait for him to come out.

00:33:21.000 --> 00:33:23.240
Take the brothers and guard his retreat.

00:33:23.240 --> 00:33:23.640
Go.

00:33:23.800 --> 00:33:24.480
Yes.

00:33:33.040 --> 00:33:33.880
Captain Meng.

00:33:34.280 --> 00:33:36.600
The girls' songs here are pretty good, aren't they?

00:33:36.600 --> 00:33:37.480
Not bad.

00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:39.880
Let's continue drinking tomorrow.

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:41.680
I'm afraid I can't tomorrow.

00:33:42.360 --> 00:33:45.200
I need to help the Imperial Army find a labor interpreter.

00:33:45.200 --> 00:33:46.860
We'll come again another day.

00:33:47.000 --> 00:33:48.800
Captain Meng, you are a busy man.

00:33:49.760 --> 00:33:51.560
Let's meet up again in a few days.

00:33:51.840 --> 00:33:52.840
Alright, see you.

00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:53.840
See you.

00:34:06.240 --> 00:34:08.360
Uncle Meng Si, hope you've been well.

00:34:08.600 --> 00:34:09.320
M-

00:34:09.960 --> 00:34:10.920
Miss.

00:34:11.360 --> 00:34:12.800
I've been waiting for you for a long time

00:34:12.800 --> 00:34:14.480
just to take your miserable life.

00:34:14.480 --> 00:34:15.199
Miss,

00:34:15.880 --> 00:34:18.040
it was all planned by Masao Tahara himself.

00:34:18.040 --> 00:34:18.770
He forced me.

00:34:18.920 --> 00:34:19.920
I didn't do it willingly.

00:34:19.920 --> 00:34:21.080
Not willingly?

00:34:21.480 --> 00:34:23.199
That uniform you're wearing

00:34:23.199 --> 00:34:25.159
was exchanged for our brothers' lives.

00:34:25.159 --> 00:34:26.280
I won't do it anymore.

00:34:26.280 --> 00:34:27.719
I'll leave the detective squad right now.

00:34:27.719 --> 00:34:28.960
I won't guide them anymore,

00:34:28.960 --> 00:34:30.080
and I won't help them find a translator either.

00:34:30.080 --> 00:34:30.880
It's too late.

00:34:31.199 --> 00:34:32.360
For what you've done,

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:33.719
according to the rules of our swordsmen,

00:34:33.719 --> 00:34:35.840
you should receive the punishment of three cuts and six holes.

00:34:35.840 --> 00:34:37.440
But I have no time to waste on you,

00:34:37.440 --> 00:34:38.639
so I'll just pierce right through your heart.

00:34:38.639 --> 00:34:39.360
Miss!

00:34:39.920 --> 00:34:40.719
Miss!

00:34:41.320 --> 00:34:42.560
I've let our brothers down.

00:34:42.560 --> 00:34:43.560
I know I was wrong.

00:34:43.600 --> 00:34:44.679
Save those words

00:34:45.679 --> 00:34:48.480
for the brothers when you go down there.

00:34:49.920 --> 00:34:50.679
Ying.

00:34:51.040 --> 00:34:51.639
What?

00:34:51.920 --> 00:34:52.850
He can't die yet.

00:34:53.080 --> 00:34:54.540
We'll take him back first.

00:34:54.600 --> 00:34:56.760
Miss, I'll go back with you.

00:35:01.800 --> 00:35:03.320
Why did you bring him here?

00:35:05.760 --> 00:35:07.620
Why didn't you kill this traitor?

00:35:09.160 --> 00:35:10.040
Baozi said

00:35:10.560 --> 00:35:11.880
we need to bring him back for questioning.

00:35:11.880 --> 00:35:13.340
What's there to question?

00:35:13.360 --> 00:35:15.680
He killed so many brothers in our stronghold.

00:35:15.680 --> 00:35:18.140
Death by a thousand cuts wouldn't be enough.

00:35:18.160 --> 00:35:19.440
If you can't do it,

00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:20.800
let me.

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:23.320
Yuan.

00:35:25.400 --> 00:35:27.400
Let me ask him a few questions first.

00:35:27.760 --> 00:35:29.960
Then you can decide whether to kill him.

00:35:37.800 --> 00:35:38.720
Boss Cai.

00:35:39.920 --> 00:35:40.880
Meng Shigui,

00:35:41.920 --> 00:35:43.320
do you want to live or die?

00:35:43.680 --> 00:35:46.000
For my wife and children, I want to live.

00:35:47.840 --> 00:35:49.840
Then answer my questions honestly.

00:35:50.120 --> 00:35:51.320
Okay, I will.

00:35:54.320 --> 00:35:56.840
Are you looking for a translator for the Japanese?

00:35:56.840 --> 00:35:57.560
Yes.

00:35:58.360 --> 00:35:59.920
The commoners in the gold mine

00:35:59.920 --> 00:36:02.040
can't understand the Japanese technicians.

00:36:02.040 --> 00:36:03.360
Accidents happen every day.

00:36:03.360 --> 00:36:04.920
They need to find a translator.

00:36:04.920 --> 00:36:06.560
So they gave this task to me.

00:36:07.600 --> 00:36:09.640
You said you truly repented.

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:11.360
Is it true?

00:36:11.640 --> 00:36:12.360
Yes.

00:36:12.680 --> 00:36:14.840
Boss Cai, just give your orders.

00:36:15.520 --> 00:36:16.360
Okay.

00:36:16.840 --> 00:36:19.600
I want you to bring our people into the gold mine

00:36:19.920 --> 00:36:21.880
and then bring them out safely.

00:36:22.160 --> 00:36:22.800
Well...

00:36:23.160 --> 00:36:24.720
The Japanese check very strictly.

00:36:24.720 --> 00:36:27.320
They verify identities entering and exiting.

00:36:28.400 --> 00:36:29.600
Do it or I'll kill you.

00:36:29.880 --> 00:36:31.960
Okay. For my family,

00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:34.490
I will do everything I can to get you in.

00:36:35.160 --> 00:36:37.040
You really are a candle that won't light until lit.

00:36:37.040 --> 00:36:39.400
Boss Huo was a prominent figure.

00:36:39.800 --> 00:36:41.840
How could he trust a traitor like you?

00:36:41.840 --> 00:36:43.280
I did it for my family too.

00:36:49.280 --> 00:36:50.200
Meng Shigui.

00:36:51.280 --> 00:36:54.000
We all know your background.

00:36:54.720 --> 00:36:56.640
Whether you want to snitch or run,

00:36:57.080 --> 00:36:58.680
the swordsmen of Sandaoyuan

00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:01.500
will settle both old and new scores with you.

00:37:01.680 --> 00:37:03.120
Understood.

00:37:03.360 --> 00:37:05.520
Yuan, take him out.

00:37:23.600 --> 00:37:25.460
Using Meng Shigui as a connection

00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:26.780
to sneak our people in.

00:37:27.000 --> 00:37:28.060
This is a good idea.

00:37:28.960 --> 00:37:31.420
Leave the job of posing as a translator to me.

00:37:31.480 --> 00:37:33.280
I still need someone to assist me

00:37:33.320 --> 00:37:34.320
near the gold mine

00:37:34.320 --> 00:37:36.120
to check out their defense layout.

00:37:36.120 --> 00:37:37.050
I'll go with you.

00:37:37.360 --> 00:37:38.680
I know a little Japanese.

00:37:38.680 --> 00:37:40.810
It will definitely come in handy then.

00:37:41.120 --> 00:37:42.180
You know Japanese?

00:37:42.600 --> 00:37:43.840
How come you never mentioned it?

00:37:43.840 --> 00:37:46.170
I just picked up a few phrases from others.

00:37:50.920 --> 00:37:51.640
Baozi.

00:38:35.040 --> 00:38:36.480
I know you are angry.

00:38:38.600 --> 00:38:39.860
He does deserve to die.

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:42.220
But keeping him alive,

00:38:42.800 --> 00:38:44.130
isn't that of great use?

00:38:44.240 --> 00:38:45.920
Is there really no other way?

00:38:47.120 --> 00:38:49.360
Do we have to use a traitor to help us?

00:38:51.920 --> 00:38:54.050
To defeat the brutal Japanese devils,

00:38:54.160 --> 00:38:56.760
it takes more than courage and determination.

00:38:58.200 --> 00:38:59.260
It also takes this.

00:39:01.640 --> 00:39:02.880
We must be good at creating all

00:39:02.880 --> 00:39:04.740
opportunities to our advantage.

00:39:06.480 --> 00:39:08.480
Keeping Meng Shigui as an inside man

00:39:08.840 --> 00:39:10.560
makes it possible to blow up the gold mine.

00:39:10.560 --> 00:39:12.490
The wealth your father left behind

00:39:12.840 --> 00:39:14.400
won't be taken by the Japanese devils

00:39:14.400 --> 00:39:16.800
and turned into weapons to kill our people.

00:39:17.720 --> 00:39:19.080
If you think about it this way,

00:39:19.080 --> 00:39:21.040
don't you think it has value?

00:39:21.440 --> 00:39:22.280
Okay.

00:39:23.000 --> 00:39:25.060
I'll spare his wretched life for now.

00:39:25.240 --> 00:39:27.240
But if he betrays our brothers again

00:39:27.520 --> 00:39:29.050
or harms the common people,

00:39:29.800 --> 00:39:31.600
I will take his head immediately.

00:39:31.600 --> 00:39:32.440
Rest assured.

00:39:32.840 --> 00:39:34.680
With your imposing presence, Miss,

00:39:34.680 --> 00:39:37.520
Meng Shigui will definitely behave.

00:39:38.120 --> 00:39:39.400
However, since we already know

00:39:39.400 --> 00:39:41.480
that he is a fence-sitter,

00:39:41.800 --> 00:39:43.960
we will keep a close eye on him at all times

00:39:43.960 --> 00:39:45.560
and give him no chance to act.

00:39:45.880 --> 00:39:46.760
Baozi.

00:39:47.520 --> 00:39:48.760
In this matter,

00:39:49.480 --> 00:39:51.740
I hope you can forgive my impulsiveness.

00:39:52.800 --> 00:39:54.920
I can't lose any more family members

00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:56.680
or friends.

00:40:00.760 --> 00:40:01.800
You won't.